#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.3.rst:15
msgid ""
"*Detailed Error Report is Displayed in Production Environment* was fixed."
" See the `Security advisory GHSA-hwxf-qxj7-7rfj "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"hwxf-qxj7-7rfj>`_ for more information."
msgstr ""
"*프로덕션 환경에서 상세 오류 보고서가 표시됨*\ 이 수정되었습니다. 자세한 내용은 "
"`보안 권고 GHSA-hwxf-qxj7-7rfj "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"hwxf-qxj7-7rfj>`_\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.3.rst:20
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.3.rst:22
msgid ""
"**UserGuide:** Fixed the descriptions for ``pre_system`` and "
"``post_system`` in :ref:`event-points`."
msgstr ""
"**사용자 가이드:** :ref:`event-points`\ 에서 ``pre_system``\ 과 ``post_system``\ 에 대한 설명이 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.3.rst:25
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_\ 를 참고하세요."
